<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee strengthens against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee strengthens against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee strengthened slightly against the dollar and weakened against the pound on Monday, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a commercial bank mean rate of 19.924 to the dollar from 19.9865 on Friday. The rupee was posted at a mean rate of 33.3145 to the pound from 33.2945 on Friday, they added.</p>
